{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7733c485976f09834c0338309eba750184ddeec9fe783f0c1b0c339414cec81f", "ja": "キケンな思いつき", "zh": "危险的突发奇想", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "95894f03afc5dc37aadb6df195b45a6657e7406a48e3d43c0d2ada068e55c290", "ja": "黒井社長への有効な対策が打てない中、美希\nは自分が黒井社長にスカウトされたことを利\n用して、スパイをしようと提案する。プロデ\nューサーは危険だと反対するが、美希は納得\nしていないようだった。", "zh": "众人想不出能有效对抗黑井社长的方法，\n此时，美希提议利用黑井社长\n想挖角自己这点，过去当间谍卧底。\n制作人认为太过危险而反对，\n但美希似乎难以接受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0f40decd8fd4427b2ccc7cf38a61d8f81df041346b2cecefd202825a71235500", "ja": "（ミルキーウェイのインストアライブに、\n961プロの黒井社長が現れた！）", "zh": "（961艺能的黑井社长\n出现在『Milky Way』的店内演唱会会场！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0f56b4c1120ff84e9ef88e8ca5a9cdd9a8c41bb8d01f5f3f899bb288902fca9a", "ja": "（『ARRIVE』の時のように、また邪魔するつもり\nらしい。話を聞いた社長が、劇場まで来てくれた……）", "zh": "（他似乎打算像『ARRIVE』那时一样，\n出手妨碍我们。社长得知以后来到了剧场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1002_president", "source_sha256": "227c895c32711c7d3416a53c38fd1dbbaa0bcdd4c163efba08761bfdd5e8da13", "ja": "そうか。黒井がまた……。", "zh": "原来如此，黑井他又……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "8b4a6737233c6ef60d38b2a052f47da59a0df1b53f091233a07bede8d39b2675", "ja": "社長のお知り合いとのことですが、\nお話を通していただくことはできませんの？", "zh": "社长，您认识他，\n有没有办法去说服他呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1004_president", "source_sha256": "a5347f4bbf36d19c006cbdb728f10e64f8ce68736d556c3d96aab2b16b9e8b7d", "ja": "うーむ、それが、一筋縄ではいかないというか。", "zh": "唔──我想事情不会这么简单。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1005_president", "source_sha256": "137687826de95c6a5a9fb4e31de18f35c906a90b5a32e054f038e232723b1452", "ja": "そもそも、私がやめてくれと頼んだら、\n逆に大喜びで邪魔をしそうな男なのだよ。", "zh": "况且，要是听到我拜托他住手，\n他反而会妨碍得更起劲吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "c8489210640d95c69bf1e958569d7840c0ba84c8d2aa6ca008a1454d56cb72c4", "ja": "な、なんか、子どもっぽいヤツだな～……。", "zh": "这、这家伙怎么这么幼稚啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1007_president", "source_sha256": "d07878bfe89e622d269a360f04f628402e791bd447173013956208a0801a92b3", "ja": "とにかく、君達にまで迷惑をかけることになって\n本当に申し訳ない。なんとかできればいいんだが……。", "zh": "总之，很抱歉把你们牵连进来。\n我真的很想为你们做点什么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "c0773af32ca330e46926ab88aa5bebc3a917a56ac8ac0a54e512efffd67d32ac", "ja": "社長が謝ることありませんよ！\n汚い手段で邪魔しようなんて、絶対に許せません！", "zh": "社长，您不用道歉！\n对方想用肮脏的手段妨碍我们，绝对不能原谅他！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "35572d99714b658d3994f4ea38507d2e97161cfda72ab4f0fb4d9e94eb6ae622", "ja": "うふふ、聖母の務めを妨げようとはいい度胸ですね～♪\nどうやって懲らしめてあげましょうか～？", "zh": "呵呵，竟敢阻扰圣母执行职责，好大的胆子～♪\n要怎么惩罚他好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d267adeb8558a0ebaeac74501e7b41c4feedc25e829e0fdf4519036a1254369c", "ja": "朋花、待ってくれ。\n危険な真似はしないで欲しい。", "zh": "朋花，等等。\n请你别做危险的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "ecf47baadc24e467ac69322396667f9cc4c9a32df6d63cbaff3723a3943eb0c2", "ja": "そ、そうだよ。黒井社長って執念深いっぽいし、\n手は出さない方がいいって……！", "zh": "对、对啊，黑井社长那个人感觉就很会记仇，\n还是别对他出手比较好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3cc49e4aacbb9bdef47fc1f764f674a0c22acc1a33310f9002e1489c633848f2", "ja": "ああ。黒井社長のことは俺に任せて、\nみんなはユニット公演に集中してくれ。", "zh": "没错，黑井社长的事情交给我处理，\n你们专注在团体公演上吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "4a9ab8af8fc4118813deb8e715fd02ebffc75549485b94579b4debe02d6e3753", "ja": "うふふ……そこまで言うなら、仕方ありませんね～。\n{$P$}さんを信じるとしましょう～♪", "zh": "呵呵……既然你都这么说了，那好吧～\n我们就相信{$P$}先生吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "638024fd9cd3ec918d873494f511edda7d976cce3f4fce02f496f94272393cfc", "ja": "ええ。わたくし達はいつも通り、レッスンを\nするだけですわ……さあ、行きますわよ！", "zh": "没错，我们只要一如往常，\n努力练习就好了……好，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1015_president", "source_sha256": "25fc88d2e2d7cd4f28c6f7f87d53cf93449cf11734f13bf4fbf213586ff94b2a", "ja": "君達に苦労をかけてすまない……。\nとにかく、できる限りの手を尽くしてみるよ。", "zh": "抱歉，辛苦你们了……\n总之，我会尽力帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1016_p", "source_sha256": "791d2c1e9494db726fa8d09c28b66c0414b405d92a0015b901a692635e9c3243", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。俺もいつも以上に\nみんなの周りに目を光らせておきます。", "zh": "麻烦您了。\n我也会更留意大家周遭的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "8c53f6886de506b20e4a154e79070f1a3eff63879e2cd5c59fd97ece52a6896b", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}。\nちょっと、お話いい？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}。\n可以过来一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "0ebaebce96c0e2f4d251e80c5efec954c7640e4ab67c2e123a66cf73b8aa9f48", "ja": "それで美希、話って？", "zh": "好啦，美希，有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1020_003mik", "source_sha256": "db70380677a0c20cefce11da2c9908ba24dcc0f03e4f34b414475dcbf79630d3", "ja": "うん。実はね、この間のライブの帰りに、\n黒井社長に961プロにおいでって言われたの。", "zh": "嗯。其实啊，之前演唱会结束要回来的路上，\n黑井社长叫美希过去961艺能那边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1021_p", "source_sha256": "e0af4646346b913cbf8cf95a17ece54a6972c52610bfdece4c016021ee4f655c", "ja": "なっ、本当か！？\n黒井社長、また引き抜きを……！", "zh": "什么？真的吗！？\n黑井社长，他又想要挖角……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e19378202771e4003c39022e6ce2b05772c9faccb67c32870b88b16b8342d2ba", "ja": "そ、それで美希はなんて答えたんだ？", "zh": "那、那美希你怎么回答他？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1023_003mik", "source_sha256": "8dcd7e2af3625f3da2add29555f16ae7226cd5489a750943be8e8df16a77ec57", "ja": "考えとくね☆　って。でも、安心していーよ？\nいいこと思いついたから、そう答えただけだし。", "zh": "美希跟他说「会再考虑☆」。不过，你尽管放心！\n美希是因为有个好主意，才没有拒绝他的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "663cbd975d9812c1583045722612018918c4adf6331fda9e0a4be03423a22d8d", "ja": "いいこと？", "zh": "好主意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "8d2a1f191925b607cf2ef68836bb8764c642bba8be3a9a3e1b3300e963532691", "ja": "ミキ、961プロにスパイしようかと思うの♪", "zh": "美希想要去961艺能当间谍♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "41c9d0574e488bdbca71b4060c2f3bce27147a3fd18b2b595a1ccc877c3997d4", "ja": "す、スパイ！？", "zh": "间、间谍！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "eb3a86d00d4b3d8cb6a3df459c6ddce9d69e4c75a2841adedd7fde8676c102d1", "ja": "そうすれば黒井社長がミキ達にどんなイジワルしようと\nしてるのか、わかるでしょ？　あはっ☆", "zh": "这样就能知道黑井社长想对美希我们做什么坏事了，\n不是吗？啊哈☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_1028", "source_sha256": "aba241772f53b48bcb588840119c5880c636c32d2b8c6dfbbcda08290bb92eed", "ja": "ダメ！", "zh": "不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d2eeb15adeb8c1fedd16a3caa975ca16ff67bae655198f2f32b6dd581a2dbad8", "ja": "ダメだ！　そんな危険なこと、させられない！", "zh": "不行！我不能让你做这么危险的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_2001_003mik", "source_sha256": "798122e56b73e680be9174db9bad34eaed34fa33d3f43d90089cfbc25d09d69c", "ja": "危険じゃないよ？\nミキ、うまくやるもん。", "zh": "不会危险啊。\n因为美希不会露馅的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_2002_p", "source_sha256": "0d639ee930828c4283019eb6ab9a2cdb7725892ce8a457ca0fb7f49e7ae8b680", "ja": "うまくやれたとしてもダメだ。美希にちょっとでも\n危険が及ぶことは、俺はして欲しくない。", "zh": "就算不会露馅也不行。哪怕只有一分的风险，\n我也不想要美希身处险境。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_2003_003mik", "source_sha256": "b3ce73a5091a701e6c9bd4e8571e01f4e6e1e1c784628d14c9e8811120095470", "ja": "むー……。", "zh": "唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0024_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0024_story_03_2004_p", "source_sha256": "512cc0b289ecf85bddb7c528d21f31ec718cd3764a4bc4bc922052e5f6438428", "ja": "（納得してないみたいだな……\n無茶をしないように、注意しておこう）", "zh": "（她似乎还是无法接受……\n看来我得再三嘱咐她不能乱来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
